# Line endings: git stores LF and checks out per platform (David works on Windows with
# autocrlf). Tool-written edits were landing with MIXED endings inside single files
# (2026-09-18: hu-global.css carried eight LF lines in a CRLF file). text=auto normalizes
# every text file on commit, so the repository never carries a mix whatever the tool did.
* text=auto

# Never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm  binary
